window.products.push({"id":1188008,"name":"Griffin Survivor Folio Case for 9.7-Inch iPad Air/Air2/Pro - Black","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615co+WnAiL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Product Description The protection of survivor meets Griffin Folio design in Survivor Journey Folio for iPad Air , i Pad Air 2 , and 9.7 inch iPad . The Case for Total Protection - Journey Folio protects your touchscreen with a no-scratch lined cover that snaps into place thanks to hidden magnets. The premium cover feels in your hand and is colour coordinated to complement your iPad’s space grey, silver, gold or rose gold finish. Drop Protection In A Snap - Remove Journey’s cover by pulling it away to release the built-in magnets and Journey Folio’s moulded flexible shell case protects your iPad from impacts from 6 feet on concrete. It’s the companion when you read or play games on your iPad . Take a Stand - Journey Folio opens and folds into a stable stand for watching video. Ready to type. Journey Folio’s got a position for that, too. Keep Your iPad Close By When You’re Working - Journey Folio can mount on metal surfaces thanks to the magnets built into the shell. Mount on a refrigerator to make shopping lists or a tool box to watch how-to videos as you work. Whatever needs doing, Journey Folio makes it easier for your iPad to help get it done. With mil-spec impact protection and its cover, Journey Folio is the protective companion for your iPad . Slim tablet protection, designed to meet or exceed military standard 810-G for protection from drops and impacts. Protects from 6 foot drops (1.8 meters) onto concrete premium moulded TPU shell with impact dispersion system moulded into the case to provide extra protection from impacts to the sides and back of your iPad magnetic Folio cover attaches with hidden magnets. Set Contains: 1 x Survivor Folio for 9.7-inch iPad 9.7-inch iPad ProiPad Air 2iPad Air","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615co+WnAiL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Griffin Technology","source_asin":"B071FWRHCL","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188008","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071FWRHCL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B071FWRHCL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
