window.products.push({"id":1188022,"name":"Blue Crane Digital InBrief Laminated Reference Card for Canon 5D Mark III (zBC543)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EZ46+EDtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Blue Crane Digital Canon 5D Mark III inBrief Laminated Card A Quick Field Reference for Your Camera Bag A laminated reference card for your camera bag. Your new Canon 5D Mark III has many controls and settings designed to allow you to make a perfect exposure. But remembering where they are and how the features work together can be daunting. If you decide to carry the user manual in your bag, you may discover that finding the answer to your question can be a time-consuming and frustrating experience. That is why Blue Crane Digital developed an abbreviated field reference guide for your digital SLR. The inBrief reference card answers most camera operation questions quickly and easily. The information is arranged logically for ease of use. The reference card is laminated with foldable hinges so it lies flat and is easily stored in your camera bag. The first panel contains a color-coded index to the rest of the panels. For instance, if you have a question about white balance, just check the index and find your answer on the purple panel. An overview of the information for each of the panels is listed below: Foldable, laminated hinges allow the inBrief to lie flat in your camera bag Foldable, laminated hinges allow the inBrief to lie flat in your camera bag Answers the most common questions about camera operation and customization Answers the most common questions about camera operation and customization Index and panels are color coded for quickly finding your answer Index and panels are color coded for quickly finding your answer Laminated 100LB card stock resists wear and weather Laminated 100LB card stock resists wear and weather Eliminates the need to carry your camera manual Eliminates the need to carry your camera manual Once you have the inBrief reference card, you can leave your manual at home!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EZ46+EDtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Crane Digital","source_asin":"B00D68R4NY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188022","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D68R4NY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D68R4NY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
