window.products.push({"id":1188143,"name":"TASCAM CC-222SLmkII Slot-loading CD & Cassette Recorder","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hRTVfefCL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Tascam CC222SLmkII CD and cassette deck now supports a more robust slot loading CD transport with adjustable pitch control. The CC222SLmkII includes a RIAA phono input which allows direct recording from a turntable; a feature which sets the CC222SLmkII above all the rest. Further solidifying the CC222SLmkII reputation for flexibility is its ability to be operated as two individual recorders; or, record one source to both recorders consecutively. It features digital I/O (coaxial and optical) for the CD and a set of RCA (unbalanced) analog ins and outs. The user can configure the ins and outs as two individual components or share the same I/O for both CD and cassette. The CD recorder includes popular features such as Auto Track Increment, MP3 playback, Power on Play, Fade In and Out, Manual Track Increment, and a variety of playback modes. Support for dual media has made the CC222 series a mainstay in houses of worship, schools, theaters and other installations. Only Tascam combination players and recorders deliver quality and reliability that consultants demand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hRTVfefCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tascam","source_asin":"B001IKQZBO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188143","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001IKQZBO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B001IKQZBO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1188144,"name":"Polaroid Hunter Green OneStep Express 600 Instant Film Camera","category":"electronics","retail price":39.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HXDcLq4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The hunter green 600 Express is a 600 type instant film camera with a single element 106mm lens that is capable of focusing as close as two feet away, suitable for both indoor and outdoor use. The shutter speed spans a range between 1/3-1/200th second with an aperture range of f/14 - f/42 to ensure capturing the image you want in a variety of lighting situations. This camera has a built-in thyristor flash that was designed to be used indoors and outdoors. The flash automatically charges when you load a film in the camera and press the shutter halfway down to take a picture.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91HXDcLq4TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polaroid","source_asin":"B00J8UI3SO","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188144","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00J8UI3SO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00J8UI3SO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1188145,"name":"ATEN 2-Port 250 MHz VGA Video Splitter VS82 (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L0mb58kBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The VS82 video splitter is not a \"Y\" connection in a box, but rather an active device performing two functions: (1) it reproduces a video signal from a single source into multiple outputs, and (2) it boosts the signal so it can be transmitted over longer distances without signal degradation. Comparing the input signal to the out put signal with advanced video signal test equipment, ATEN's VS82 exhibits excellent performance characteristics on DC offset and white level tests. These results provide measurable proof that the VS82 represents the truest color reproduction possible from original signal input to multi signal outputs. ATEN's Video Signal Enhancement (VSE), technology automatically compensates the output video signal making allowances for the distance between the VS82's output and the monitor's input, thereby deliveringptimal signals for use by your monitors Package Content: 1 x VS82; 1 x VGA cable (6 ft.); 1 x Power adapter (0AD1-0909-031G); 1 x Wall/Rack Mount Kit; 2 x Screw","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L0mb58kBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ATEN","source_asin":"B003TJ9WUS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188145","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003TJ9WUS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B003TJ9WUS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
