window.products.push({"id":1188149,"name":"101AV Security Camera System 16CH 1080P HD H.265/H.264 2in1 DVR/NVR, HD-TVI/CVI/AHD/IP, HDMI/VGA/BNC Video Out, Phone APPs for Home & Office, Work w/ ","category":"electronics","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416pR78hfAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"a. 16CH HD DVR/NVR without HDD. Combination of 24 total Analog + IP cameras; Supports 16 Analog + 8 IP cameras, 15 Analog + 9 IP ... or 8 Analog + 16 IP cameras by IP Address. Triplex: Live / Playback, Record, Network. Standard H.265/H.264 Video Compression with low bit rate and better image quality. Support 1 x SATA HDDs (Each HDD can up to 8TB). Exceptionally strong password and anti-hacking protocols to increase privacy and security. Snapshot, and Email notifications for real time protection. b. Pre-Alarm Recording and Motion Detection. Motion activated full screen alarm call up protection with optional audible warning. Dual-stream: network video and local recording. CMS remote monitoring software on PC. Up to 1080P HDMI and VGA Video Output Resolution. USB Backup and USB Mouse. c. Multiple video formats input including Full HD/TVI/CVI/AHD, SD/960H/composite video, and IP/network to work with various existing and new HD surveillance system. Full HD picture quality for solid day & night surveillance applications. TVI & AHD up to 5MP, CVI up to 1080P, and IP camera up to 8MP resolution. Multiple Video Out connectors for extra viewing needs including: HDMI/VGA/IP network video monitoring. DVR is compatible with all ONVIF compliant IP cameras. d. User friendly setup instructions including QIG (Quick Installation Guide) for PC based VMS/CMS integration. Cloud based cell phone APPs for both Android and iPhone without confusing port forwarding, and real time Snapshot alarm notification. There are options to show 1, 4, 8, and 16 cameras simultaneously on both the mobile APP on cell phone and also the Central Monitoring Software (CMS) on PC. e. Recording Resolution: 5MP Lite@6fps, 4MP Lite@8fps, 1080P Lite (960x1080)@15fps, and 720P@15FPS, US Local Support (Office Hour 8:00AM - 5:30PM, Mon to Fri, Pacific time). We are the sole distributor of 101 AV Inc products. There are no authorized 3rd party resellers of our products. f. Hybrid DVR/NVRs allow you to start with analog cameras and then gradually upgrade to IP cameras as your budget allows. This is a major advantage over software-dependent NVRs, which can only use IP cameras. This can save you money in the long run. g. Software-dependent NVRs are typically obsolete within a few years, as the software is updated and the OS is revised. Hybrid DVR/NVRs, on the other hand, are not dependent on software, so they can last for many years. This can save you money on replacement costs. h. Hybrid DVR/NVRs are typically more reliable than software-dependent NVRs. This is because they are not dependent on a single software platform, so they are less likely to be affected by software bugs or security vulnerabilities. i. Hybrid DVR/NVRs are typically easier to use than software-dependent NVRs. This is because they have a more intuitive user interface and they do not require any special knowledge of networking or IP addresses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/416pR78hfAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"101 AV Inc","source_asin":"B07SJJMGB5","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188149","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SJJMGB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SJJMGB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
