window.products.push({"id":1188471,"name":"DOF Reality Motion Simulator Platform H6 (6 Movements Axis) Flight, Racing car Plane Cockpit","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KNuGs4WhL._AC_.jpg","description":"DOF Reality H6 Motion simulator platform delivers 2 dimensional movements (Pitch + Roll + rear traction loss/Yaw+ Heave, Sway, Surge). The H6 model is designed to move not only the seat, but, all simulator controls: steering wheel, joystick, pedals, throttles, etc. When you move, everything moves! It’s very quiet, with no need for a dedicate a room or garage. The nosiest elements in our design are cooling fans at 24 dBA, it is silent compare to other actuators based platforms. It was designed with a minimum space requirement, ease of assembly and will pass through most door openings. It’s compact, yet powerful. We sell only the platform, you need to purchase seat, wheel, pedal, gear shift etc separately. DOF Reality ready to play includes: solid metal rig for normal & F1 pose; mounts for wheel, pedals, shifter & VR; mounts for seat or sliding rails; integrated power drive motors; 110v control unit with USB; SRS license; quick assembly tools; 1 year full warranty. We sell only the p’n’p motion platform, Customers need to purchase own seat, VR, controllers (wheel, pedal etc). Our platform supports any of them. Seat mounts are 280мм deep(front to back) and (345,375,405)mm wide. Supported max pilot weight 330 lbs. Our mission is to make universal plug and play motion simulator platform affordable for many gaming enthusiasts and professionals. We have incorporated industry leading electronics, encoders and motors within our products. The durability of the DOF Reality is extremely high for its price point, and the maintenance requirements are minimal. Each unit we ship is built to our high standards, and goes through extensive Quality Assurance testing and tuning before been disassembled and packed for shipping. The assembly required is as easy as IKEA furniture with all hardware and tools provided by us. All our units comes with a 1 year faulty part return to base warranty (does not cover wear and tear). We are not afraid of competition. We simply don’t have any!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KNuGs4WhL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOF Reality Motion simulators","source_asin":"B083XQ9KK2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188471","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083XQ9KK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B083XQ9KK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
