window.products.push({"id":1188492,"name":"Pyle PUNP32BT Vintage Retro Classic Style Bluetooth Turntable Phonograph Speaker Sound System","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B7VUHsvSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Pyle Vintage turntable system combines yesterday's classic record playing style with today's latest technology. Built-in Bluetooth and full range stereo speakers allow you to wirelessly stream music from devices like iPhones, Androids, Smartphones, iPads, Tablets, etc. The system is equipped with an elegant gramophone phonograph horn that can become the center-piece and add flare to any room in the house. The unique Vinyl-to-MP3 recording function and included USB cable gives you the ability to save all of your old records into digital MP3 files -- share your music with family and friends! Turn that stack of old records into a space-saving compact digital music library. Listen to all of your records thanks to the (3) speed selectable vinyl playback ability (33, 45 or 75 RPMs). Additional features include the ability to connect external devices with the Aux (3.5mm) input jack, single front-loading CD player tray, AM/FM radio and USB flash drive memory reader -- all designed to fill the area with rich stereo sounds! Enjoy the classic and iconic style along with today's latest hi-tech features with the Pyle Vintage Bluetooth Turntable Phonograph Speaker System.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61B7VUHsvSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyle","source_asin":"B013OVZ5EM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188492","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013OVZ5EM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B013OVZ5EM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
