window.products.push({"id":1188606,"name":"iHillon 4 Pack Compatible with Fitbit Versa Bands/Fitbit Versa 2 Bands for Men Women, Soft Silicone Sport Wristbands Compatible with Fitbit Versa Lite","category":"electronics","retail price":15.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716XFs+AKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Designed For Versa Watch】Our silicone sport band is compatible with Fitbit Versa /Versa 2 /Versa Special Edition /Versa Lite Watch. This breathable waterproof band is well-designed, allowing your wrists to maintain ventilation and comfort. It is not only flexible and durable, but also smooth and odorless, definitely the best choice if you are looking for a replacement versa/versa 2 band. 【Size Available for Men&Women】Our bands compatible with Fitbit Versa/Fitbit Versa 2 fit for 5.5\"-7.9\" wrist., with multiple holes on the band and you can easily adjust the band into a suitable size, perfectly fit for women, men, boys and girls in sport, business, daily life and party. With stainless steel buckle and unique tuck design, help to keep the band in place securely and firmly. 【Easy to Install & Secure Fit】Each versa 2/versa band comes with 2 upgraded stainless steel connectors pins on both ends, super easy to remove and install. To attach a wristband: First, insert the pin into the indent; Second, press the pin rod to slide the top part into the other indent; Third, check to see if the versa band was attached successfully. All of our bands can seamlessly fit into your versa interface and ensures the stability and security. 【3 Row Perforations Design】These versa bands/versa 2 bands for women and men have amount of breathable holes, which can keep your wrist from sweating and the water will not sit under the band. Great help during hot weather or strenuous exercise. Comfortable and durable for daily wear, sports and swimming, does not irritate or rub your skin. 【Colorful Choices Versa Bands】Each package will come with 4 different color bands and 8 metal pins. You can definitely choose a band to match your daily outfit, daily mood and different occasions. It is a great partner for going to party, camping, hiking, work, travelling, etc. Any questions with our bands, please contact us and we will definitely provide you a nice solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716XFs+AKGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iHillon","source_asin":"B088BJ85P2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188606","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088BJ85P2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B088BJ85P2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
