window.products.push({"id":1188610,"name":"BJC Silver-Plated Stereo Audio Cable, 3 Foot, Assembled in USA","category":"electronics","retail price":48.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qdWa17pVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BJC Silver Plated Stereo Audio Cable, 3 ft Many of our customers ask about silver or silver-plated conductors as an alternative to copper. While we’re partial to copper for various reasons, there are those who prefer silver, and this cable is for them: silver-plated copper conductors, with our usual high-quality Canare RCA plugs. Like most of what we sell, these cables are assembled in the USA at our Seattle shop. The Cable: Belden 734D2 The cable stock in these stereo pairs is Belden 734D2. This was originally developed as a DS3/DS4 digital coaxial audio cable for multiplexed telephone systems, but its attributes are excellent for unbalanced analog audio as well; coaxial geometry is best for unbalanced audio, where noise rejection is a function of shield effectiveness alone rather than common-mode noise rejection. It offers low capacitance (16.8 pF/ft) and excellent braid-over-foil shielding, and has a 20 AWG silver-plated copper center conductor. The Connectors: Canare RCAPs We use Canare crimp-style RCA plugs on this cable; these have gold-plated contacts on both the pin and the ground side, and employ a unique circular spring ground contact to allow a very firm and definite engagement with the jack, but one which disengages easily and without any risk of jack damage from over-tightness. Blue Jeans Cable: Professional Cable Assembly We assemble these audio pairs in our Seattle shop, using precision stripping and crimping equipment for high-quality termination. Blue Jeans Cable has been assembling audio and video cable for the stereo and home theater market since 2002, always using the best broadcast-quality parts and assembly practices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qdWa17pVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Jeans Cable","source_asin":"B01N43WP1X","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188610","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N43WP1X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N43WP1X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
