window.products.push({"id":1188687,"name":"MSI GT83VR TITAN SLI-212 18.4\" Hardcore Gaming Laptop Core i7-7920HQ GTX 1080 SLI 64GB 1TB NVMe SSD + 1TB Mech KB VR Ready","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XIp4TZjQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"7TH GENERATION INTEL CORE i7 PROCESSOR The perfect combination of MSI gaming laptops with 7TH GENERATION INTEL CORE i7 PROCESSOR will give up to 10% better performance for a smoother VR experience. The 7th generation Intel Core H series processor utilizes a power-efficient microarchitecture, advanced process technologies, and silicon optimizations to deliver faster performance over previous generations. THE POWER OF GEFORCE GTX 10-SERIES GRAPHICS MSI is the world’s 1st gaming laptop powered by GeForce GTX 1080 SLI GPU delivering almost double the performance over single GPU solutions. With new technologies in Cooler Boost, you can game harder and never worry about being throttled. Additionally, the all new Dragon Center offers a 1-Click VR solution to optimize your laptop for VR. EXPERIENCE IPS LEVEL COLOR Don't settle for washed out colors. Experience lifelike gaming visuals with an all new 178 degree wide viewing angle IPS panel. AN EYE OPENING EXPERIENCE WITH TRUE COLOR TECHNOLOGY MSI's exclusive True Color Technology is precisely calibrated to deliver vibrant colors, stunning details, and sharp images. True Color Technology brings the colors of the world right to your display. NAHIMIC 2 VIRTUAL SURROUND SOUND MILITARY TECHNOLOGY FOR GAMERS Nahimic 2 specializes in 3D sound enhancement processing and audio emprovements offering virtual 7.1 surround sound in immersive HD. With the all new Sound Tracker feature, gamers will be able to see with an on screen indicator where the sound is originating from. Nahimic will highlight crucial sounds while reducing external noise for an immersive gaming experience. COOLER BOOST TITAN Crush the heat with all new redesigned Whirlwind Blade fans. Dedicated thermal solutions for both the CPU and GPU with a total of 15 heat pipes ensure maximum performance under extreme gaming. CHERRY MX SPEED SILVER SWITCHES W/ RGB MULTICOLOR BACKLIGHTING This is the first and only gaming laptop in the world to have a Cherry MX Speed Sliver RGB Switches onboard. Cherry’s new MX Speed switches have the best response and tactile feedback with a 1.2mm mechanical actuation, light 45g operation key switches and durable gold contacts. Designed and made by MSI, this masterpiece is now capable of lighting up the dark with multi-color RGB backlighting. The perfection of gaming is here. CUSTOMIZABLE STEEL SERIES KEYBOARD During gameplay, SteelSeries Engine 3 serves as your firearm. With SSE3, customize your lighting with multiple backlit colors, program personalized macros, and sync it all through the cloud.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XIp4TZjQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MSI","source_asin":"B01N1WRU85","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188687","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1WRU85","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1WRU85","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1188688,"name":"Baader AstroSolar Visual Solar Filter Film (ND 5) - 6\" (152mm) Square Piece","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zCf+YoWqL._AC_.jpg","description":"Baader AstroSolar Safety Filter Film - visual optical density (OD) or neutral density (ND) of 5.0. The filter film blocks 99.999% of the solar intensity; i.e., it has a transmission of 0.00001 or 0.01% only. This is suitable to make your own front-mounted solar filters for telescopes, binoculars, spotting scopes, or large camera lenses. In Sept 2000, Sky & Telescope magazine proclaimed Baader Planetarium's AstroSolar Safety Film to be \"the new standard in solar filters.\" This film provides white light views of the Sun that are unmatched by any other front-mounted solar filter or material. The views display fine solar details, including fine penumbral detail in sunspots, solar granulation, & lighter colored faculae. Anyone can construct a complete low cost, high quality, white light solar filter for any telescope, binoculars, or camera lens. With AstroSolar Film the Sun appears in its real color - neutral white (with a slight bluish tint). Other films & glass filters produce a blurry bluish or reddish/orange/yellow solar image, thereby cutting part of the spectrum. Especially with an orange sun, it is very hard to see faculae regions which are visible predominantly in the blue portion of the light spectrum. At first glance, Baader Solar Film appears to be like thinner aluminum foil. You will often notice streaks, bends, warps, or dents on the Baader film you receive. This is absolutely normal, & it does not imply that the filter film is defective. The optical & mechanical properties of the film are not compromised. The film is very thin but resilient. Basic instructions are included to make your own filter. Just search online resources for hundreds of other instructions, ideas, photos, etc. Carefully cut in the US from larger sheets if purchased from AgenaAstro. Important - you cannot see solar prominences with white light solar filter film such as this - that requires the use of sophisticated and much more expensive & specialized H-alpha solar filters or telescopes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zCf+YoWqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Baader Planetarium","source_asin":"B071ZG95JV","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188688","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071ZG95JV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B071ZG95JV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
