window.products.push({"id":1188716,"name":"KODAK Smile Instant Print Digital Camera (Green) Soft Case Kit","category":"electronics","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BoyhMDfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Spread a smile—in an instant! Tired of those bulky instant print cameras cramping your style? Shutterbugs no longer have to grin and bear it! With the new Smile Instant Print Digital Camera from KODAK you can snap, edit and share photographs anytime, anywhere, and in totally discreet fashion. For the first time, our portable camera/printer slides open from its compact state to reveal a powerful 8mm lens. Use the LCD viewfinder to zoom in, let the fixed focus work its magic, and capture the scene with incredible color and HD clarity. Editing features also let you apply flattering filters and other effects before printing. The Smile’s joyful design includes a durable case in a variety of cool color combinations. Other conveniences include a built-in strap slot; MicroSD card reader; touch control panel; easy LCD navigation; 2 picture modes; preview feature; automatic flash; and a rechargeable battery with up to 40 prints per charge. Most importantly, the camera’s instant printer uses innovative zero ink technology—no film or cartridges required. Load the 2x3 ZINK photo paper (starter set included) into the device to print on the spot. It’s time to turn that frown upside down. Add the KODAK Smile to your cart today! What You Get 1 x Smile Instant Print Digital Camera from KODAK 1 x USB cable 1 x ZINK Zero Ink paper starter pack Quick start guide A pocketful of snappy sunshine! Specs & Details Camera sensor: 5mp Max resolution: 10MP by interpolation Lens: 8mm Color: black/white Compatible paper: 2”x3” ZINK zero ink How to Enjoy Use the quick start guide to get your Smile set up Keep the case closed to protect the lens for travel When ready to snap, slide open so it’s happy as a clam Take, edit and share your pics easier than ever Give an awesome gift for boys, girls and adults of all ages!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BoyhMDfKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KODAK","source_asin":"B0BWGW8PX5","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188716","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWGW8PX5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWGW8PX5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
