window.products.push({"id":1188745,"name":"VIZIO M3D550KD 55-Inch 120Hz Class Theater 3D Edge Lit Razor LED LCD HDTV with VIZIO Internet Apps (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CSLhHPmgL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Bring that intense 3D movie experience home with VIZIO's 55-Inch Class Theater 3D LCD HDTV. Winner of Popular Science's Best of What's New 2011, Theater 3D is advanced, flicker-free 3D that's better and brighter than conventional 3D. Including four pairs of lightweight, battery-free glasses you can wear at home or at the movies, this HDTV puts next-generation 3D well within reach. From the Manufacturer Bring that intense 3D movie experience home with VIZIO's 55-inch class Theater 3D LCD HDTV. Winner of Popular Science's Best of What's New 2011, Theater 3D is advanced, flicker-free 3D that's better and brighter than conventional 3D. Including four pairs of lightweight, battery-free glasses you can wear at home or at the movies, this HDTV puts next-generation 3D well within reach. The Difference Is Crystal Clear: State-of-the-Art Technology State-of-the-art technology pushes beyond the boundaries of conventional 3D TV with a picture up to twice as bright, featuring a wider range of viewing angles that makes it ideal for movie nights, sports viewing and gaming. Theater 3D also displays traditional HDTV content with the same brilliant clarity and superior picture quality that goes into every VIZIO HDTV. Learn more about 3D, how it works, and exactly what you'll need to enjoy 3D at home at our 3D Center . Brilliance With Style: Theater 3D Glasses Battery-free Theater 3D glasses deliver superior immersive 3D TV, with a lightweight frame that’s designed for maximum comfort. They’re practical and durable for large get-togethers at home, yet state-of-the-art enough to use at your local multiplex.* A World of Content: Games, Movies, and Sports Put yourself right in the thick of the excitement with games like Ghost Recon: Future Soldier **, now available in 3D. Thrilling 3D blockbusters like Titanic *** and Transformers **** leap off the screen to make movie night an unforgettable experience. The action spills right into your living room with sports programming like ESPN 3D that takes game day excitement to a new level. Wi-Fi Technology The latest 802.11n Wireless Networking is built-in making connecting to the Internet quick and easy. Learn more about smart TVs in Amazon's Smart TV Center. Plug & Launch Connecting is easy and hassle-free. Just turn on your HDTV and let the on-screen set-up wizard guide you through a few simple steps. Browsing is a Breeze A simple interface makes searching, browsing and switching between apps and internet content as easy as channel-surfing. Automatic Updates VIZIO Internet Apps automatically updates to ensure you're always running the current version and accessing the latest content. Crystal-Clear Full HD Full HD gives you over 2 million pixels, making the clarity and detail of your picture razor-sharp. VIZIO’s 1080p Full HD enhances every image with dazzling clarity to deliver a lifelike picture with unparalleled precision and fidelity. LED Brilliance Premium Edge Lit LED lines your screen’s interior perimeter with dazzling LED backlighting, so you can enjoy first-rate color and brilliance packed into an amazing, ultra-thin profile. *Compatible with RealD 3D. ** Ghost Recon: Future Soldier © Ubisoft. All rights reserved. *** Titanic © Paramount Pictures. All rights reserved.**** Transformers © Dreamworks Video. All rights reserved.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CSLhHPmgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIZIO","source_asin":"B0088024O4","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188745","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0088024O4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0088024O4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
