window.products.push({"id":1188841,"name":"Sony SRF-M37W Walkman Digital Tuning Weather/FM/AM Stereo Radio (Black)","category":"electronics","retail price":79.74,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p2aEIzK1L._AC_SL1092_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Listen to the weather or your favorite radio stations in clear, stereo sound and enjoy 20 station presets with this Walkman digital tuning weather radio. Not only does the Sony SRF-M37W Walkman digital radio run for hours on just one \"AAA\" battery, it also features five handy Direct Key Preset Memory buttons that jump straight to your favorite stations no matter what frequency you're in. There's also a digital clock and battery life indicator plus Weather Band Tuning Function for the latest local forecasts. Headphones and a belt clip are included for your convenience. Hours of listening on a single AAA battery and included stereo headphones Weather Band Tuning Function Use the weather band tuning function to listen up-to-the-minute weather from your local weather band broadcasts. 1 AAA Battery Operation The SRF-M37W provides hours of listening on a single AAA battery and helps to make the Walkman radio compact and inexpensive to use. Included Accessories Stereo headphones are provided to let you listen in private, and and included belt clip ensures quick attachment to a belt. 20 Station Preset Memory The 20-station memory presets use electronic settings for easy one-button tuning for your choice of audio from 5 weather band, 10 FM and 5 AM stations. A Direct Tuning keypad allows you to electronically tune into any 5 stations you set Digital Clock and Battery Indicator A built-in indicator lets you keep track of the correct time and provides a visible indication of when battery power becomes low. Direct Weather Button Use the Direct Weather button to access your local weather forecast at the touch of a button. 5-Key Direct Tuning Preset Memory A Direct Tuning keypad allows you to electronically tune into any 5 stations you set, even if in different frequency bands with the press of a single, easy-to-reach button. FM Local/Distance (DX) Switch The built-in DX switch provides optimal reception of both close and distant radio stations. What’s in the box: Sony SRF-M37W Walkman Digital Tuning Weather Radio (Black), Belt Clip, Headphones and 90-Days Labor & 1-Year Parts Limited Warranty. Technical Specifications Antenna System: AM: Built-in Ferrite Bar Antenna; FM: Headphone Cord Antenna Antenna System: AM: Built-in Ferrite Bar Antenna; FM: Headphone Cord Antenna Format(s) Supported: FM/AM Radio Format(s) Supported: FM/AM Radio Frequency Range: AM: 530-1710kHz; FM: 87.5-108MHz; Weather Band: Ch. 1-7 Frequency Range: AM: 530-1710kHz; FM: 87.5-108MHz; Weather Band: Ch. 1-7 Station Presets: 20 (5 AM, 10 FM, 5 WB) Station Presets: 20 (5 AM, 10 FM, 5 WB) Tuner Type: Digital Tuner Type: Digital Display: LCD Display: LCD Battery Life: Up to 54 Hours Battery Life: Up to 54 Hours Output Power: 2.8 mW + 2.8 mW (at 10% harmonic distortion) Output Power: 2.8 mW + 2.8 mW (at 10% harmonic distortion) Power Requirements: 1 AAA Battery Power Requirements: 1 AAA Battery","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61p2aEIzK1L._AC_SL1092_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sony","source_asin":"B004SKBJUS","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188841","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004SKBJUS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B004SKBJUS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
