window.products.push({"id":1188845,"name":"USB C Charging Cable Power Cord Compatible with Beats Fit Pro, Beats Flex, Beats Studio Earbuds, JBL Charge 4, Sony WH-1000XM4 WH-1000XM3 WH-XB900N Ea","category":"electronics","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gtn52Ro-S._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compatibility Model: 1. Beats Flex, Beats Studio Earbuds 2.JBL Charge 4, JBL Flip 5, JBL JR POP, JBL Endurance PEAK 3.SONY WH-1000XM4, WH-1000XM3, WH-XB900N, WH-H910N, WH-H810, WH-CH510, WH-XB700  4.and the Other Same USB Type C Ports Device. (Note: Please Check Your Device Connector, the USB Type-C Cable Not Fits Any Micro Ports Devices.) Package Included: 1 x 5FT USB C Charging Cord for Beats Flex Durable Quality: Sturdy Construction, More Durable and Sturdier for a Longer Lifespan. After-Sales Warranty: If There's any Quality Question of Our Items, Please Contact Us and We Will Provide After-Sales Service for You.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gtn52Ro-S._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TPLTECH","source_asin":"B093WQLLKL","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188845","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093WQLLKL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B093WQLLKL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1188846,"name":"LilyPad FTDI Basic Breakout - 5V","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K6y58kxrL.jpg","description":"This is the LilyPad revision of our FTDI Basic. It is the same as our other FTDI Basic, but has a purple LilyPad board which is half the thickness. This is a basic breakout board for the FTDI FT232RL USB to serial IC. The pinout of this board matches the FTDI cable to work with official Arduino and cloned 5V Arduino boards. It can also be used for general serial applications. The major difference with this board is that it brings out the DTR pin as opposed to the RTS pin of the FTDI cable. The DTR pin allows an Arduino target to auto-reset when a new Sketch is downloaded. This is a really nice feature to have and allows a sketch to be downloaded without having to hit the reset button. This board will auto reset any Arduino board that has the reset pin brought out to a 6-pin connector. The pins labeled BLK and GRN correspond to the colored wires on the FTDI cable. The black wire on the FTDI cable is GND, green is CTS. Use these BLK and GRN pins to align the FTDI basic board with your Arduino target. This board has TX and RX LEDs that make it a bit better to use over the FTDI cable. You can actually see serial traffic on the LEDs to verify if the board is working. This board was designed to decrease the cost of Arduino development and increase ease of use (the auto-reset feature rocks!). Our Arduino Pro boards and LilyPads use this type of connector. One of the nice features of this board is a jumper on the back of the board that allows the board to be configured to either 3.3V or 5V (both power output and IO level). This board ship as 5V, but you can cut the default trace and add a solder jumper if you need to switch to 3.3V.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41K6y58kxrL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SparkFun","source_asin":"B005K0MYPE","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188846","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005K0MYPE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B005K0MYPE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
