window.products.push({"id":1188972,"name":"Cerwin-Vega Cvhd-5.1 Cvhd Series 6-Speaker Home Theater System (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k4HekggvL._AC_.jpg","description":"Home-Theater demands great surround sound that captures the depth, presence, and clarity of a real movie house and delivers it to your home. The 5.1 channel Cerwin-Vega CVHD Series 6-Speaker Home Theater System does this beautifully and remembers that your home may have limited space. The 4 satellites and the center-channel are slim, with small footprint, yet don't compromise on overall frequency range. A powered subwoofer with a 12-inch deiver rounds out the lowest bass frequencies for definitive, deep sound. Sonically, the Cerwin-Vega CVHD Series excels?thanks in large part to premium components housed in superior enclosures. Neodymium magnets in the woofers and tweeters provide a high performance-to-weight ratio, with the result being crystal-clear highs for natural sounding, intelligible dialog and exceptional reproduction of music and sound effects. Additionally, the satellites employ 1.25-inch treated silver Mylar tweeters for improved definition and acoustic clarity. Optional stands for satellites and center are not included in purchase price. Wall brackets are included. Drivers - (1) 1 Soft Dome tweeter (6) 3 Cellulose Composite Cone Woofer Video Shielded (Each) Dimensions (HxWxD) - 22.5 x 5 x 5 (Each) Weight - 6.32 lbs. (unpacked) Wall mount bracket & hardware included Integrated 150Hz Highpass Filter for bridging with subwoofer CVHD's powered subwoofer offers the power and the capacity to deliver the low frequency drama that you would expect from Cerwin-Vega Bass. This beefy 12 inch power subwoofer has the size and air volume to offer the low frequency range for full impact and drama on music, movies, and games. Frequency Response 28Hz _ 150Hz 12 Woofer, Bass-Reflex Enclosure Built-in Amplifier - 250 watts continuous Unit Dimensions (HxWxD) - 17.75 x 16.75 x 16.5 Weight - 48.5 lbs. (unpacked) Continuously Variable Crossover - 50Hz-150Hz Phase Adjustment","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41k4HekggvL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cerwin-Vega","source_asin":"B000JRKLIA","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1188972","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JRKLIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JRKLIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
